    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61413" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωφ-άω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωφός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make dumb, silence</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαν ἰωήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.286
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>grow dumb</i> or <i>deaf, become stupid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἀπαιδευσίας κεκωφημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>maim, injure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
